{"candidateAnswer":"Bella and Luna.","evidence":"[D30:1 | 12:10 am on 11 August, 2023] Maria: Hey John! Long time no talk! Guess what - I got a puppy two weeks ago! Her name's Coco and she's adorable.\n[D31:4 | 3:14 pm on 13 August, 2023] Maria: Her name is Shadow! She's full of energy and always puts a smile on my face. She's been a great addition to my life. They get along great.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c3e2ff24-5f55-5065-950a-027bb3cddd9b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6d9a82997c8509868716d7c456ed6e2939ef7ac914f2764b44da2cacc6038742","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are Maria's dogs' names?","referenceAnswer":"Coco, Shadow","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6d9a82997c8509868716d7c456ed6e2939ef7ac914f2764b44da2cacc6038742"}}]}